@startuml
title Edit Existing Workout Plan

|User|
start
:Log into application;
:Open My Workout Plans;
:Select workout plan;

|System|
:Load workout plan;

|User|
:Edit sets/reps;

|System|
:Validate changes;

if (Valid input?) then (yes)
  :Update workout plan;
  :Save to database;
  :Return updated plan;
else (no)
  :Show error message;
endif

|User|
:Review updated plan;

stop
@enduml
